&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences Principal, Business Development (EMEA), you will partner with EMEA Sales and Sales Engineering leaders to shape and execute the region’s HLS growth strategy. You will connect market opportunity to field execution: prioritizing segments and accounts, developing repeatable vertical and horizontal plays, strengthening the organization and partner ecosystem, and leading critical customer and alliance initiatives. You will be expected to operate comfortably at three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Strategic: Define where and how Everpure should win in European healthcare and life sciences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Organizational: Build the capabilities, coverage, relationships, and operating cadence required to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial: Personally advance priority opportunities, alliances, and executive relationships to closed business and measurable customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a combination of HLS credibility, technical fluency in data and AI platforms, commercial ownership, and the ability to influence across country sales, SE, partners, and corporate teams without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Sales, Europe will be responsible for leading our regional sales organization, driving Planet’s Go-To-Market (GTM) strategy, and accelerating revenue growth across national security, defense, and government sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a people manager and business leader, you will own the regional revenue target, drive executive alignment, and establish disciplined pipeline governance to ensure forecast predictability. You will be responsible for building, mentoring, and coaching a team of direct reports—fostering a culture of accountability, operational excellence, and continuous professional development. In addition to team development, you will architect large-scale strategic programs, lead high-stakes commercial negotiations, and scale partner ecosystems to penetrate priority markets. Above all, you will leverage your leadership experience to elevate Planet’s market presence across NATO and the Nordics in alignment with our mission to see change and change the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an accomplished sales leader with deep defense domain expertise and a track record of managing high-performing teams across Alliance structures and Northern European markets. You will bring an established executive network spanning NATO HQ, allied Defense Ministries, Armed Forces Commands, Intelligence Agencies, and key European Prime Contractors/System Integrators. Combining strategic commercial acumen with an understanding of collective defense and national security priorities, you will position Planet as a trusted capability provider for mission-critical operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in the United Kingdom or Germany. If located near an office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Strategic Revenue Growth: Own and execute a result-oriented Go-To-Market (GTM) strategy to build, negotiate, and close high-value, complex deals across sovereign defense and government sectors, consistently hitting or exceeding regional quota targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast Governance &amp;amp; Predictability: Maintain rigorous pipeline hygiene (Salesforce.com) and deliver accurate, data-driven revenue forecasts to executive leadership through disciplined deal inspection and pipeline management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture Strategy &amp;amp; Value Messaging: Engineer tailored capture strategies and high-impact executive narratives that align with agency-level priorities, resonate with key decision-makers, and win competitive procurements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, Coach &amp;amp; Empower: Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing sales team, establishing a culture of accountability, operational excellence, and continuous professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodology Alignment: Train and inspect direct reports on core sales methodologies and capture frameworks (e.g., MEDDPICC, Shipley), coaching them on deal qualification, stakeholder mapping, and win strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Bench &amp;amp; Scaling: Proactively recruit, onboard, and retain elite commercial and defense-domain talent to build a solid talent bench as the regional footprint expands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Matrix Alignment: Orchestrate seamless collaboration across internal matrix teams including Government Affairs, Product, Engineering, and Field Marketing to align corporate capabilities with regional market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Post-Sales Win Alignment: Partner closely with Pre-Sales/Solutions Engineering to secure technical wins, and collaborate with Post-Sales teams to ensure flawless customer onboarding, retention, and long-term expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Cadence &amp;amp; Executive Escalation: Communicate deal velocity transparently across internal business units, mobilizing executive sponsorship and cross-functional support when needed to de-risk complex pursuits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant work experience and 6+ years supervisory / leadership experience, with a track record of driving revenue growth, building high-performing teams, and consistently exceeding multi-million-dollar individual and team quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to recruit, mentor, and retain top-tier talent, instilling a high-accountability culture and coaching direct reports through complex, multi-year deal cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience establishing pipeline discipline, accurate revenue forecasting, and thorough deal inspection using Salesforce.com and modern sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDPICC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive background navigating complex government, NATO, and defense procurement frameworks (e.g., NCI Agency, FMS/DCS, national MoD acquisition bodies) across Northern Europe and Allied Command structures, with a focus on key Nordic nations (Sweden, Finland, Norway, Denmark).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established, C-level network across Defense Ministries, Intelligence Agencies, Allied Commands, and European Defense Primes / System Integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how commercial technology and advanced data feeds support Allied posture, sovereign defense, intelligence, and ISR missions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success collaborating across internal matrixed teams (Government Affairs, Product, Engineering, Legal) to align corporate capabilities with regional opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, self-directed leader with commercial judgment, adept at leading teams through dynamic, high-growth, or startup-like market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #1d1c1d; background-color: #f8f8f8;&quot;&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of progressive sales leadership and enterprise business development experience within the defense, national security, or government technology sectors, with a track record of building high-performing teams and consistently exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational understanding of NATO defense priorities, Nordic security dynamics, joint acquisition processes, and agency decision-making across Allied Ministries of Defense and Tier-1 Defense Primes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex, multi-year deal cycles, with the ability to lead sales teams through disciplined capture frameworks, pipeline governance, and accurate revenue forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in a Nordic language (Swedish, Finnish, Norwegian, Danish) is a plus for engaging senior government ministers, military command leadership, and internal executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
