&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering Tailscale. If this job description resonates with you, please apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We encourage you to help us break that statistic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tailscale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tailscale is making safe connection effortless by delivering software that makes it easy to securely interconnect people and their devices, no matter where they are. From hobbyists to multinational corporations, teams of every size use Tailscale each day to protect their networks, share access to internal tools, and more. We&#39;re building a future for the Internet that&#39;s easy, sensible, and safe, like it used to be. Founded in 2019 and fully distributed, we&#39;re backed by Accel, CRV, Insight, Heavybit, and Uncork Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tailscale is redefining secure networking by making it simple for organizations to securely connect people, devices, and workloads anywhere in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tailscale, we&#39;re solving one of the most fundamental challenges in modern infrastructure: secure connectivity. Our product is loved by developers, trusted by IT and security teams, and rapidly expanding within organizations of every size. As adoption accelerates, we are investing in a regional sales motion that matches the scale of our ambition across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a founding Sales Director, EMEA to build and lead one of Tailscale&#39;s most important growth initiatives. This is a rare opportunity to shape how a category-leading company enters and scales a major region, develops strategic customer and partner relationships, recruits an exceptional team, and creates the operating model for long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a regional leader, seller, coach, and builder. You will own the EMEA sales strategy and lead teams across multiple customer segments, while personally helping advance the region&#39;s most important opportunities and executive relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will define regional priorities, territory and segment strategy, hiring plans, outbound and expansion motions, and the operating cadence for the business. You will also help spearhead partnerships across the region, including channel, cloud, technology, and strategic alliance relationships that can accelerate customer acquisition and expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially, you will lead a focused team of Account Executives across multiple segments and work closely with Customer Engineering, RevOps, Marketing, GTM Engineering, and Executive Leadership. As the business grows, you will play a central role in scaling the team, developing frontline leaders, and building the regional organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This UK-based role reports directly to the President and offers the opportunity to build Tailscale’s EMEA sales organization from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the EMEA Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp; the current team and build the EMEA sales organization and go-to-market motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Develop the regional strategy, operating model, territory design, account segmentation, and coverage plan across multiple sales segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Set clear regional priorities and translate company goals into executable plans for new business, expansion, and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Establish repeatable playbooks that reflect the needs of customers and markets across the UK and broader EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Provide regional market insight that helps shape company strategy, product priorities, and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead From the Front&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Personally support and, when appropriate, lead Tailscale&#39;s highest-value and most strategic EMEA opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Develop trusted executive relationships with CIOs, CISOs, CTOs, infrastructure leaders, security leaders, and business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the regional executive sponsor and quarterback for complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Coach teams on discovery, qualification, account strategy, executive engagement, negotiation, and deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Navigate technical, commercial, legal, procurement, and executive stakeholders to drive successful customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Scale Multiple Segments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Lead Account Executives serving multiple customer segments, from commercial and mid-market organizations through enterprise and accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Create differentiated motions, coverage models, and performance expectations appropriate to each segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Recruit, hire, onboard, and develop exceptional sales talent across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Build a high-performance culture grounded in accountability, collaboration, curiosity, customer value, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Develop future leaders and create the management structure required as the EMEA organization scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Regional Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Help define and execute the EMEA partnership strategy alongside the Partnerships organization and Executive Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Identify markets and customer segments where partners can accelerate awareness, pipeline creation, implementation, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Create clear rules of engagement, joint account plans, and co-selling motions with priority partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Represent Tailscale with senior partner executives and at relevant regional customer and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Pipeline and Regional Awareness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Lead an outbound-first and account-based sales motion across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Personally build executive relationships within high-priority accounts and partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with SDRs, Marketing, GTM Engineering and Partnerships to create qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Build scalable account planning, prospecting, event, community, and partner-sourced pipeline programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure the region develops a balanced pipeline across customer segments, products, countries, and sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Own regional forecasting, pipeline health, hiring plans, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Establish a rigorous operating cadence across forecast reviews, pipeline creation, deal inspection, account planning, and talent development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Use data to identify trends, improve execution, allocate resources, and communicate regional performance to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Product and Engineering to provide structured customer and market feedback from EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Build the metrics, processes, and cross-functional relationships required to scale the organization effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;An experienced sales leader who has built or materially scaled a high-growth SaaS business in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;A proven leader of teams spanning multiple customer segments, with the judgment to adapt the sales motion by segment and market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;A builder who is comfortable operating with ambiguity, limited infrastructure, and significant ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;A strong seller and coach with a consistent record of winning complex new-business and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Experienced in recruiting, developing, and retaining high-performing Account Executives and sales leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated success building outbound pipeline and establishing repeatable regional go-to-market motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Experienced developing channel, technology, cloud, reseller, or strategic partnership relationships in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Executive presence and credibility with CIOs, CISOs, CTOs, and senior business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Strong business acumen and experience navigating complex buying committees, procurement processes, and enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Deep familiarity with the UK and broader EMEA technology market; additional European language skills are valuable but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;This role is based in London and is hybrid (2-3 days/week in-office) with ability to travel throughout EMEA as needed. &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll Thrive Here If You...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Want to build a region rather than inherit a mature organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy leading from the front while creating leverage through managers, teams, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Can balance strategic planning with hands-on customer and deal leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Are energized by developing different sales motions for commercial, mid-market, enterprise, and strategic customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;See partnerships as a core growth lever rather than a separate or secondary function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Want to leave a lasting impact on how a category-leading company expands internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company, we strive to maintain fair and equitable compensation practices within our team across all roles and all levels. Tailscale&#39;s compensation package includes base salary, equity, and comprehensive benefits. The salary range displayed on each job posting represents the target range for a new hire&#39;s base salary. Individual offers may vary based on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An inclusive, flexible environment where you can be your authentic self.&lt;/strong&gt; We recognize the impact of diverse voices and backgrounds on the growth of our people, product, and company. And that flexibility in how and when you work empowers our team to integrate work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A competitive total compensation package.&lt;/strong&gt; This includes a base salary, an equity incentive plan and variable commission (for quota-based roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive group benefits with no waiting period. &lt;/strong&gt;Take advantage of coverage for health, vision, dental, and more for you and your family!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote first company&lt;/strong&gt;—most of our teams work fully remotely. Enjoy a change of scenery wherever you can get wifi, participate in virtual and in-person social events, and leverage our corporate co-working program to visit WeWork (or other similar spaces near you). Some roles require in-office collaboration depending on team needs, which will be clearly noted in the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer-funded retirement contributions. &lt;/strong&gt;Tailscale will match your retirement contributions dollar-for-dollar, up to a maximum annual employer contribution equal to 0.75% of your eligible compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect with other Tailscalars IRL. &lt;/strong&gt;Attend our annual company retreat, participate in team off-sites, and collaborate in person with teammates across Canada, the United States, the United Kingdom, and Singapore. We support intentional in-person connection through team travel and distributed collaboration.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support for your personal and professional development.&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your career thoughtfully with $1500 USD annually for professional development, or take advantage of mentorship, coaching, and internal promotion opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off and a healthy work-life integration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Our flexible, paid time off program supports you for any situation life throws your way, whether moving homes or travelling the world!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A build-your-own home office setup. &lt;/strong&gt;You choose your own company-owned laptop (Mac or PC), receive a monthly home internet reimbursement, and $500 USD to customize your workstation to make it your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave program&lt;/strong&gt;. We care about your life outside of work and encourage new parents to take advantage of parental leave top-ups (20 weeks for birthing parents, 16 weeks for non-birthing parents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tailscale is committed to providing an accessible and inclusive hiring process. If you require an accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process or related to any aspect of this role, please contact your recruiter.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our hiring process uses AI-assisted tools to help screen and assess candidates. All hiring decisions are made by people.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware that legitimate emails from Tailscale&#39;s talent team will only originate from ----- ----- and ----- email addresses. For more information about protecting yourself from impersonators and scams, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&quot;&gt;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-113912706363268805m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coreweave.com&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a Living Wage accredited Employer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EMEA Startup Business Development organisation will help make CoreWeave the preferred platform for the next generation of AI-native companies. The team will build relationships and programmes across the institutions that create, fund and accelerate startups, then convert that ecosystem position into qualified opportunities and practical advantage for CoreWeave’s country field teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director, Startup Business Development – EMEA will report to the Vice President and Managing Director, EMEA and lead the development of CoreWeave’s startup and venture capital business across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a business development overlay role. Country sales teams will retain account ownership, opportunity management and revenue responsibility across the Startup, Digital Native and Enterprise segments. You will build the relationships, propositions, programmes, market intelligence and operating mechanisms that help those teams identify the right companies earlier, engage them before platform decisions are established and win them onto CoreWeave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build and lead a team spanning priority geographies and regional programmes. Initial focus will include the United Kingdom, France, Germany, the Nordics, Benelux and Israel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In This Role, You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute CoreWeave’s EMEA startup business development strategy, operating plan and investment priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a systematic view of the regional startup opportunity, identifying the markets, investor portfolios, technology categories and companies most likely to become significant consumers of AI infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear criteria for prioritising startups based on technical ambition, compute intensity, funding trajectory, workload timing, leadership quality and strategic value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build senior relationships with venture capital firms, seed and growth investors, accelerators, universities, research laboratories and founder communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic engagement plans for priority ecosystem organisations and create repeatable mechanisms for portfolio introductions, founder support, technical engagement and market intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position CoreWeave as the preferred AI infrastructure and developer platform for companies with meaningful training, fine-tuning, inference and applied-intelligence requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage founders, CTOs, researchers and investors before infrastructure architectures and platform relationships are firmly established.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create qualified opportunities and introductions for country Startup and Digital Native field teams, connecting high-potential companies rapidly to the right sellers, technical resources and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with country sales leaders to define target companies, ecosystem priorities and engagement strategies while maintaining clear account ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate strategically important opportunities across Sales, Field Engineering, Product, Engineering, Capacity, Finance, Legal, Marketing and Customer Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear programme eligibility, investment and graduation criteria, ensuring activity is focused on durable platform adoption and commercial potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the regional voice of the startup ecosystem inside CoreWeave, translating market insight into recommendations for Product, Engineering, Capacity, Marketing and commercial leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead and develop a high-performing EMEA Startup Business Development team with complementary programme and geographic coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a rigorous operating cadence and scorecard covering ecosystem coverage, target-company engagement, field acceptance, sourced and influenced pipeline, technical activation, consumption and downstream commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the first 12 months, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the EMEA startup business development strategy, operating plan and investment priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and launch CoreWeave’s proposition for AI startups at different stages of formation and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and launch the initial portfolio of regional startup and venture ecosystem programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the organisation, hire the initial team and establish coverage across priority programmes and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, segment and onboard the venture capital firms, accelerators, universities and research organisations most relevant to CoreWeave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish senior relationships and strategic engagement plans with priority ecosystem partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create mechanisms for portfolio introductions, technical engagement, founder support and joint planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a prioritised target list of high-potential AI startups and research spinouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map priority investor portfolios against CoreWeave’s ideal startup profile and connect qualified companies to the appropriate country sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear ways of working with country field sales teams, including qualification, routing, account assignment, handoff, executive sponsorship and attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective operating mechanisms with Product, Engineering, Field Engineering, Marketing, Capacity, Finance, Legal and other supporting groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement the business review cadence, measurement framework and attribution model required to assess ecosystem and field impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in business development, sales, partnerships, startup go-to-market or venture ecosystem leadership within cloud infrastructure, enterprise technology, AI or another complex technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant leadership experience building and operating startup, venture capital or ecosystem programmes across multiple EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of converting ecosystem relationships into qualified opportunities, technical adoption, pipeline, consumption and commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience developing senior relationships with venture capital firms, accelerators, universities, research organisations, founders, CTOs and technology executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with country sales organisations to create demand and accelerate customer acquisition without displacing account ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the startup lifecycle, from formation and seed funding through venture growth and scaled commercial operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying promising companies early and assessing their technical ambition, infrastructure needs, funding trajectory and long-term potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud infrastructure, AI platforms, developer tooling and the requirements of AI-native companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build structured programmes, operating mechanisms and performance measures that scale beyond personal relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience aligning Sales, Field Engineering, Product, Marketing, Finance, Legal and executive stakeholders around shared opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and operational capability, including market segmentation, portfolio analysis, opportunity attribution and executive business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, hiring, coaching and developing high-performing business development or ecosystem teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of operating successfully across EMEA markets and cultures, with the ability to travel regularly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience within the startup organisation of a major hyperscale cloud provider, AI platform company or global infrastructure technology business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience building or scaling a regional startup business measured through customer acquisition, workload adoption, consumption and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing the operating model between a regional startup business development organisation and country-based sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established senior relationships across the EMEA venture capital and AI startup ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with compute-intensive AI companies across training, fine-tuning, inference, applied AI or AI platform development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating startup programmes or technical adoption mechanisms that helped companies progress from experimentation to scaled production workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing product, capacity and go-to-market decisions using insight from founders, investors and startups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will also consider an exceptional senior venture ecosystem builder who has strong credibility with EMEA investors and founders, can identify high-potential technical companies early and has translated ecosystem access into measurable commercial outcomes for a technology platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience focused primarily on events, sponsorships, brand awareness or community activity will not, by itself, be sufficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering If You’re a Good Fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in investing in our people and value candidates who bring different experiences, even if they do not meet every requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built a startup business or ecosystem and understand that credibility must ultimately produce customer and field outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move comfortably between a venture capital partner, a technical founder, a country sales leader and an internal product executive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine a strong external network with the discipline to build repeatable systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You recognise promising companies early and make clear recommendations about where CoreWeave should invest time and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You measure success through the quality of companies won, workloads activated and value created for field teams, not activity alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with urgency, commercial judgement, curiosity and a strong bias toward execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun and move fast. We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth, we’re not afraid of a little chaos and we’re constantly learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking, and foster an environment that encourages collaboration and innovative solutions to complex problems. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, with the opportunity to help shape CoreWeave’s future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. &amp;nbsp;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Updated privacy notice - UK and EU Job Applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by CoreWeave UK Ltd. (“Controller”), which is located at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phosphor (6th Floor), 133 Park Street, London, SE1 9EA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;and can be contacted by emailing ----- Controller’s data protection officer can be contacted at ----- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of (i) Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”) and (ii) the GDPR as it forms part of the laws of the UK (“UK GDPR”), as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment. Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. With respect to transfers originating from the UK or the European Economic Area (&quot;EEA&quot;) to a country outside the UK or the EEA, we implement the appropriate transfer mechanism(s) and other appropriate solutions to address cross-border transfers as required by applicable law. You may request a copy of the suitable mechanisms we have in place by contacting us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment. Where permitted by applicable law, we may also retain your personal data for a limited period after the recruitment process ends in order to consider you for future job opportunities, respond to legal claims, or comply with record-keeping obligations. Under the GDPR and the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority: (i) A list of Europe’s data protection authorities can be found &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ec.europa.eu/justice/article-29/structure/data-protection-authorities/index_en.htm__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9xVQGfFw$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;; and (ii) for the UK, this is the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ico.org.uk/__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9IDhJOUA$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information Commissioner&#39;s Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For additional information, please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.coreweave.com/docs/policies/terms-of-service/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Optiver is building its Digital Assets trading capabilities and is looking for a Cloud Infrastructure Engineer. This role sits in the Global Cloud Platforms team and will report to the Global Head of Cloud Platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help build the foundations for a new trading tenancy on Optiver’s existing cloud platform. With a mature hybrid cloud infrastructure already in place, this role allows you to optimize it for the unique operational and performance needs of digital assets trading. Your focus in this role will be on extending our cloud platform to meet the performance demands of a latency-sensitive, always-on trading environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be accountable for delivering a secure, performant, and robust infrastructure that directly supports trading outcomes - stability, latency, resilience, and safe change in the digital assets space.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;90178b36-1533-4fba-a68f-f0dfa998524d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;897&quot; data-local-id=&quot;48e875951c89&quot;&gt;Design low-latency infrastructure using cloud primitives and optimized configurations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;987&quot; data-local-id=&quot;da1c8a2e9eaa&quot;&gt;Own and enhance cloud infrastructure performance setups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1047&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3574dd1373b7&quot;&gt;Build and run high-throughput, resilient connectivity patterns for exchange integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1140&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e914103bef35&quot;&gt;Drive security hygiene both on and off cloud with secrets management, network segmentation and traffic isolation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1257&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b5ac5538b2ed&quot;&gt;Implement governance and best practices for shared cloud platform ensuring safe multi-tenant operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1364&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4bc5151ca872&quot;&gt;Deliver infrastructure as code using Terraform and Terragrunt, following Optiver standards and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1473&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0e2d5d057390&quot;&gt;Build and maintain CI/CD and automated testing for changes minimizing risk in always-on markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1573&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4564e4471d45&quot;&gt;Implement and enhance observability using CloudWatch, Prometheus, Grafana, and similar tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1670&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74302d166102&quot;&gt;Participate in operational ownership through incident response, post-incident improvement, and continuous hardening.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;65f19967-362a-4756-aa9a-3e3c96bab0d0&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1813&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f1131234aba0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated expertise in owning production infrastructure as an engineer (Platform, SRE, or Infrastructure engineering background).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1949&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e558f5021616&quot;&gt;Deep cloud infrastructure knowledge, especially around VPC design, compute optimization, and performance networking features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73dccfe69027&quot;&gt;Proven ability to write and maintain Terraform modules and operate &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;IaC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; safely through reviews, testing, and deployment pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2211&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ecf647044526&quot;&gt;Solid Linux fundamentals, including networking and systems performance tuning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2293&quot; data-local-id=&quot;514e6b604cd7&quot;&gt;Ability to program in at least one language (e.g., Python or Go) for tooling, automation, and integration work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2408&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed5a78dae74b&quot;&gt;Collaborative skills to work effectively with other team members and stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2495&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d7a899ef422a&quot;&gt;Ability to communicate technical information to both technical &amp;amp; non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2591&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bff2446714d2&quot;&gt;Ability to gauge business problems and prioritize tasks accordingly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f72641d95ebb&quot;&gt;Strong preference will be given to candidates with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;933b6239-4f43-4b27-89f8-d113a398bf6d&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2718&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5ef5eba4d494&quot;&gt;Experience managing multi-cloud (AWS, GCP, AliCloud, etc) infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2795&quot; data-local-id=&quot;554b77d5d45a&quot;&gt;Experience building &amp;amp; managing latency-sensitive systems in cloud (trading, real-time systems, market data, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2913&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cd20f940cfec&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience managing WebSocket infrastructure under burst load and unstable upstream conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3021&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f80273a4ea64&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of exchange rate limits / quota models (including weight-based limits) and how to engineer systems to respect them without compromising trading performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3201&quot; data-local-id=&quot;339ec05fff38&quot;&gt;Familiarity with high-performance networking concepts (e.g., &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SR-IOV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, kernel/network tuning, exposure to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RDMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;/&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DPDK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is a plus).&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;197&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 paid vacation days plus all UK public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily breakfast and lunch, along with support on commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance, pension scheme, and ClassPass fitness membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7055&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-background-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-background-custom-color=&quot;#fedec8&quot;&gt;Are you interested in furthering your career on one of the most dynamic and exciting trading floors in Europe?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7055&quot;&gt;Apply directly via the form below. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cannot accept applications via email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
