&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job title: Director, Quality &amp;amp; Release Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: London or Bristol (Hybrid Office - 3+ days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £150,000 - £180,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: Quality &amp;amp; Release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level: Director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London or Bristol and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The quality engineering function is shifting&amp;nbsp; from manual oversight and process governance toward an AI-assisted product development lifecycle where QA leads its own domain test strategy and bespoke tooling drives automation maturity.&amp;nbsp; This role will drive this shift in our organization and ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own quality and release governance at programme level, directly manage an engineering team building AI-assisted automation and test data capability, and set the standard that QA leads across delivery streams work to. You will be as comfortable driving change as you are accountable for outcomes. Responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Quality Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the quality strategy across delivery streams, aligned to programme objectives and client SLAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain release governance frameworks — release readiness criteria, risk acceptance, and sign-off authorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set quality standards and coverage expectations; ensure QA leads translate these into domain-level test strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive defect governance at programme level — internal and client-facing SLA compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent quality and risk in senior leadership, architecture, and product forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Tooling &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly manage a team of engineers building and maintaining bespoke automation tooling, leveraging AI and LLM capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the test data management strategy — including AI-assisted synthetic data generation and environment data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and select off-the-shelf AI testing tools; define governance frameworks for their use and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure governance gates are maintained as AI participation in the PDLC grows — accountable humans must remain in the loop for risk acceptance and production judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish tooling standards that QA leads can adopt across domains without creating dependency on a central bottleneck&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QA Function Leadership &amp;amp; Operating Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and performance-manage QA leads embedded across domains; define the operating model and career framework for the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the accountability split clearly: QA leads own test strategy and tooling choices for their domain; this role owns the standard they work to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistency across streams without becoming a handoff point — enable QA leads to move fast within well-defined guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a quality engineering culture — not a bug-finding one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Management &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the transformation of QA practice from script maintenance to intelligent, risk-based, AI-assisted quality engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive upskilling across the function — building capability in AI tooling, context engineering, and agent-assisted workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resistance and build confidence in new ways of working; bring the team through change without losing them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate quality outcomes in business terms to senior stakeholders — escaped defect rates, release stability, risk posture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the release quality process end-to-end: environment strategy, regression coverage, go/no-go decisions, and post-release monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed shift-left practices — quality gates early in the PDLC, not just at release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the tension between delivery velocity and release stability, particularly as AI-generated code volumes increase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading a QA or quality engineering function of significant scale — including embedded domain leads and direct management of practitioners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has directly managed engineers building tooling or automation infrastructure — not just managed QA practitioners executing test plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has delivered a meaningful QA transformation: AI adoption, automation maturity uplift, defect governance overhaul, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has worked in a multi-client or multi-product platform environment, managing quality outcomes across concurrent delivery streams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has owned release governance in a complex, multi-stream delivery context — including go/no-go accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to energy, utilities, billing, or similarly regulated complex domains is a plus — not essential&lt;br&gt;Strong grounding in test strategy, automation frameworks, and CI/CD integration — sufficient to credibly lead engineers building these things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of LLMs and AI tooling in a QA context: test generation, defect triage, coverage analysis, synthetic test data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands test data management principles and the challenges of environment data integrity at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to evaluate build vs. buy for tooling; assess AI testing platforms with appropriate scepticism&lt;br&gt;Comfortable setting strategy and being accountable for outcomes — not just owning process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to operate at programme level with senior engineering and product stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in leading distributed, multi-timezone quality functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator — translates quality metrics into business outcomes; can make the case for investment in tooling and governance&lt;br&gt;Demonstrated experience leading practice transformation in an engineering context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to bring people with them through transitions that challenge established ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity; can hold direction steady while the detail is still being worked out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with observability, production monitoring, and shift-right quality practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About The Team:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about building food safety standards and driving product quality? We are looking for someone with technical experience to drive food safety and quality compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Food Safety &amp;amp; Quality Assurance team is recruiting and we are looking for an experienced and highly driven Food Safety professional to join our international team. You will work within a team based across Europe to drive food safety and quality compliance with our Produce, Herbs &amp;amp; Fruit (PHF) suppliers, and work collaboratively with our procurement, sourcing, supply chain and distribution centre teams. The role will share best practice, create standardized ways of working, drive improvement in food safety &amp;amp; quality and lead on various strategic projects to ensure we delight our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform on-site supplier visits and audits to manage their approval and drive strategic improvements in quality to decrease complaints and increase customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your expertise and knowledge from industry and the supply base to develop best practice ways of working with your suppliers and internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically manage supplier product quality and performance. Delivering focussed error (complaint) reduction initiatives and identifying projects that will improve our quality and safety standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with internal and external stakeholders to ensure optimal performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and manage quality issues with suppliers to ensure customer availability and quality is not compromised with thorough root cause analysis and corrective action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your category area to achieve key performance indicators relating to out of specification deliveries, customer complaints, and compliance metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and coordinate the onboarding of new suppliers and products ensuring compliance to food safety, legal and quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in quality and food safety management, ideally within the produce industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in auditing food manufacturers; additional food safety qualifications (e.g. HACCP, internal auditing) are highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel, including some international trips; 50% of time spent at suppliers, distribution centres and the base office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication and negotiation skills; pragmatic in solving time-sensitive issues - German skills are a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident decision-maker who remains calm under pressure and in challenging situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced environment with the ability to multitask across competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with cross-functional and international teams across HelloFresh markets (UK, DACH, France, Nordics, BNL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;intermediate to advanced skills in Google Suite / MS Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Dashlane&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;Dashlane’s mission is to deliver the credential security every business and employee needs to thrive. Millions of consumers, and over 25,000 brands worldwide, such as Michelin, Air France, and Forrester, trust Dashlane for industry-leading innovations, patented zero-knowledge security, and an unmatched user experience. Founded in Paris, Dashlane has since established offices in New York and Lisbon, and has grown to more than 300 Dashlaners globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who actively use AI tools to drive efficiency, creativity, and impact in their work. At Dashlane, we drive innovation and value learning, strive for excellence in everything we do, and thrive as one team. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;life at Dashlane&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-work&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;how we hire&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/benefits-dashlane&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;benefits of being a Dashlaner&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 0.0in;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dashlane is currently looking for an experienced, hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Lead Accountant&lt;/strong&gt; to take end-to-end ownership of our French entity’s financial operations as our primary local finance lead in Paris. Reporting directly into the US-based VP, Global Controller, this high-impact role places you at the center of a dynamic, international team where you will manage everything from local statutory compliance to global reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position based in Paris, you will lead day-to-day accounting operations: spanning General Ledger, Month-End Close, Payroll oversight, Revenue Recognition (US GAAP ASC 606), VAT/Tax filings, CIR preparation, and the annual French Statutory Audit, while collaborating closely with international teams across the US and Portugal. You will modernize workflows through automation, champion the adoption of AI-assisted accounting tools, and mentor our local Staff Accountant to support their professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-specific information:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be based in Paris, with English and French as your working languages. We offer a&amp;nbsp;hybrid work arrangement, with Monday, Tuesday and Thursday in-office, and Wednesday&amp;nbsp;and Friday as remote. Tuesday is the office company-sponsored meal.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End French Accounting Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the complete month-end close process for the French entity and maintain local accounting books in close collaboration with the global accounting team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statutory Audit &amp;amp; Tax Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the annual French Statutory Audit, manage tax/VAT filings, and coordinate the annual CIR (Crédit d&#39;Impôt Recherche) preparation with Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Financial Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Global Controller on the annual US GAAP audit, internal controls, and special international accounting projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Recognition &amp;amp; B2B Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage US GAAP ASC 606 revenue recognition, support payment automation, and oversee B2B invoicing, AR collections, and local compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Payroll Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor third-party payroll JEs and accruals, process vendor bills and credit cards with proper GL coding, manage T&amp;amp;E compliance, and perform balance sheet reconciliations (bank, fixed assets, and balance sheet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Leadership &amp;amp; System Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimize French accounting systems (Pennylane ERP) and lead project management for the 2027 French e-invoicing compliance initiatives across AP and AR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Decision-Making:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate ambiguity to make sound accounting decisions with incomplete data in a fast-paced environment, balancing technical precision with operational flexibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster an open, supportive environment by sharing knowledge, managing workload to hit tight deadlines, and collaborating across global and local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder &amp;amp; Vendor Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong professional relationships with external third parties, including payroll vendors, audit firms, and statutory partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and regularly update internal process documentation to ensure financial data integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Workflow Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Modernize French accounting operations by adopting AI-assisted tools and automated workflows to accelerate reconciliations, month-end close, AR/AP, and accruals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Accounting or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant accounting and tax experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong French Statutory accounting knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GAAP - ASC 606 Revenue Recognition knowledge (particularly within subscription or multi-channel B2B payment models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in French and English (spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Pennylane and NetSuite or other large ERP systems (or similar modern financial platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills (for complex data analysis, reconciliations, and financial modeling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and accuracy, structured and autonomous working style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic business judgment and ability to balance technical accounting precision with operational speed, applying a sharp sense of materiality to navigate ambiguity and solve complex issues in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine passion for sharing knowledge and fostering an open, supportive team environment, focusing on coaching, empowering, and elevating colleagues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and diplomacy skills to build seamless, high-trust relationships across international internal teams and key external partners (auditors, payroll vendors, tax authorities).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take full accountability for local financial outcomes, bringing a proactive, solution-oriented approach to organizing priorities, resolving operational challenges, and consistently delivering under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Are Also Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US GAAP accounting knowledge&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong enthusiasm for AI and digital transformation, with a drive to leverage modern AI tools and workflow automation to streamline reconciliations, close processes, and financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct hands-on experience coordinating annual French R&amp;amp;D tax credit (CIR) preparations alongside technical and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to collaborate across time zones and enthusiasm to connect in person at our global hubs in Lisbon and the US 2–3 times per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What Dashlane offers you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Equal Parental leave -&amp;nbsp; regardless of gender, up to 20 weeks fully paid leave to take care of their new baby, within the first year of birth or adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health insurance covered by Dashlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mentorship program - select your mentor from our internal pool and continue your learning path!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commute allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Meal Vouchers (Swile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mental health services through Spring Health for you and family members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;4 extra days off (one per quarter) to acknowledge the importance of your wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Spot in daycare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Time off saving account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Donation matching program -&amp;nbsp; give back to the community and support actions that lead to positive social impact under the historically marginalized communities. Every donation will be matched by Dashlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team buildings &amp;amp; seasonal social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Weekly lunch in the office and monthly happy hour and many more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging at Dashlane:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a truly international company—founded in France and &lt;span style=&quot;color: #172b4d;&quot;&gt;distributed across&lt;/span&gt; France, US and Portugal—Dashlane thrives off diverse perspectives. We value all aspects of diversity: gender identity, sexual orientation, ability, ethnic origin, social background, age, lifestyle, and more. We are committed to hiring a diverse community and fostering a culture where everyone is heard and belongs. See more about this &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/diversity&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;d1c12b7e-4df1-44c5-a10f-2644909c66db&quot;&gt;Your interview experience:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To know what to expect once you’ve sent your application, &lt;a href=&quot;https://lifeatdashlane.com/how-we-hire&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;read about how we interview and hire at Dashlane&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to browse our blog to find more information about our product and how we work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;En bref&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rejoins le supermarché mobile à la croissance la plus rapide d’Europe, en devenant un pilier essentiel de notre équipe People ! En tant que Payroll Specialist chez Picnic, tu garantis la paie et la conformité de +1000 collaborateurs. Sous la responsabilité de notre Payroll Lead et en collaboration avec un autre Payroll Specialist, tu évolues dans un cadre multi-sites encadré par différentes CCN pour une activité variée et sans routine. Dans un environnement international où certains processus sont déjà automatisés, nous cherchons à optimiser les autres pour te concentrer sur l&#39;humain et l&#39;expertise. Si tu allies rigueur, autonomie et goût de l&#39;amélioration continue, rejoins-nous !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Gestion et préparation de la paie :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; Collecter les EVP et préparer la paie multi-CCN/établissements avec le prestataire.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administration du personnel :&lt;/strong&gt; Assurer l&#39;onboarding, l&#39;offboarding, la gestion de la mutuelle, acomptes et STC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion administrative &amp;amp; social :&lt;/strong&gt; Traiter la paie intérimaire, rédiger les courriers RH et piloter les dossiers prévoyance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Imports &amp;amp; Données :&lt;/strong&gt; Automatiser et intégrer les fichiers d&#39;import (embauches, absences, EVP) sur le logiciel de paie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support &amp;amp; Proximité :&lt;/strong&gt; Répondre aux questions via ticketing (en français/anglais) et effectuer des déplacements ponctuels sur site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partenariat HRBP :&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborer étroitement avec les HRBP pour garantir la conformité et le suivi disciplinaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entre 2 et 4 ans d’expérience dans la gestion de paie (une expérience multi-sites / multi-CCN est un plus) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bac +3/5 (ou diplôme équivalent) en Paie/RH ou dans un domaine lié ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solides compétences sur Excel (ou équivalent) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aisance avec les logiciels de paie (la connaissance de ADP Globalview est un plus) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es suffisamment à l&#39;aise en Anglais pour échanger à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral avec des collaborateurs et équipes support internationales ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solides connaissances en droit du travail et en droit social français ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à s’adapter, attrait pour l&#39;optimisation des processus et autonomie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍴 Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine toute équipée met également à disposition de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Santé et transports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec SideCare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, si tu as besoin de te rendre au travail en transports en commun, nous te remboursons ton abonnement à hauteur de 50%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎫Sorties et divertissement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profite d&#39;un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achat, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore). Tu profiteras aussi d&#39;invitations à tous nos événements récurrents comme notre très convoitée Summer Party !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍️ Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à un environnement dynamique, jeune et international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏝️Repos pour recharger tes batteries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu disposeras de 25 jours de congés payés par an ainsi que des RTT au prorata du nombre de jours travaillés sur l’année (forfait de 218 jours par an).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;perks-content&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Rejoignez-nous dans notre mission de transformer la façon dont les gens commandent et apprécient leurs repas. Chez Deliveroo, notre équipe Brand &amp;amp; Experience crée des expériences engageantes qui renforcent le lien entre notre marque et nos clients, partenaires et livreurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un·e &lt;strong&gt;Assistant·e Chef de Projet Marketing Fidélisation&lt;/strong&gt; en alternance pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing à Paris, pour une durée de &lt;strong&gt;12 mois&lt;/strong&gt;. Aux côtés de l&#39;équipe Fidélisation, vous contribuerez au développement de &lt;strong&gt;Deliveroo Plus&lt;/strong&gt;, notre programme d&#39;abonnement, en participant au déploiement de campagnes marketing et en accompagnant des projets à fort impact sur l&#39;acquisition, la rétention et la fidélisation de nos clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce que vous ferez&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de l&#39;équipe Fidélisation, vous travaillerez en étroite collaboration avec les Marketing Managers ainsi qu&#39;avec les équipes CRM, Brand, Media, Creative, les équipes commerciales et nos partenaires stratégiques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au quotidien, vous serez amené·e à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordonner la création des campagnes Deliveroo Plus en rédigeant et en pilotant les briefs CRM, créatifs et juridiques avec les équipes locales, globales et les agences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adapter et localiser les campagnes marketing internationales pour le marché français en garantissant leur cohérence avec notre identité de marque.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assurer le suivi des performances des offres Deliveroo Plus et contribuer à l&#39;identification des opportunités d&#39;optimisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Préparer les reportings hebdomadaires et mensuels destinés à nos partenaires stratégiques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participer aux lancements de campagnes marketing 360° (CRM, digital, TV, influence, événementiel et in-app) en coordonnant les différentes parties prenantes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Réaliser une veille concurrentielle sur les programmes de fidélisation et partager des recommandations pour enrichir notre stratégie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce qui vous permettra de réussir&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous préparez un diplôme de niveau Bac+4 ou Bac+5 en école de commerce, université ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en marketing, communication ou digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous vous reconnaissez dans les points suivants :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes organisé·e, rigoureux·se et savez gérer plusieurs projets en parallèle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous avez une excellente communication écrite et orale en français ainsi qu&#39;un bon niveau d&#39;anglais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes à l&#39;aise avec les chiffres et aimez analyser les performances pour en tirer des recommandations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous appréciez le travail en équipe et la coordination de nombreux interlocuteurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes curieux·se, proactif·ve et souhaitez évoluer dans un environnement dynamique et en forte croissance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Pourquoi rejoindre Deliveroo ?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Deliveroo, vous aurez l&#39;opportunité de contribuer à des projets concrets ayant un impact direct sur des millions de clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En rejoignant notre équipe, vous bénéficierez :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;D&#39;un accompagnement tout au long de votre alternance par des experts du marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;D&#39;une forte exposition à des projets stratégiques et à des équipes internationales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;D&#39;un environnement collaboratif où l&#39;autonomie, l&#39;innovation et l&#39;apprentissage sont encouragés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;D&#39;une expérience au sein d&#39;une entreprise technologique internationale en constante évolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Notre processus de recrutement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre objectif est de vous permettre de montrer votre potentiel dans les meilleures conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le processus comprend généralement :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un échange avec notre équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un entretien avec le manager de l&#39;équipe Fidélisation pour échanger sur vos motivations, votre façon de travailler et découvrir davantage l&#39;équipe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Construire un environnement où chacun a sa place&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Deliveroo, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité de nos équipes fait notre force. Nous accueillons toutes les candidatures, quelles que soient l&#39;origine, le genre, l&#39;âge, le handicap, l&#39;orientation sexuelle, l&#39;identité de genre, les convictions ou le parcours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si vous avez besoin d&#39;un aménagement particulier durant le processus de recrutement, n&#39;hésitez pas à nous en faire part.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt·e à rejoindre l&#39;aventure Deliveroo ? Nous avons hâte de vous rencontrer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Swiss offices are at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant in our Zurich/Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around three to five years in consulting, or in a technical/date-focussed role with client-facing responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine dual affinity for business and technology. You are comfortable with modern data and AI concepts - generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud platforms - and with what they cost and where they fail, not only with what they are called.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built AI or data products, not only advised on them. You can explain why you chose which model you put on which part of the work, and what that choice did to both output quality and cost. You will not be writing production code in this role, but you should have the basic understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;126&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Senior Technical Consultant / Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the design and delivery of impactful AI and data solutions. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with client advisory, guiding multi-disciplinary teams from opportunity framing to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Own solution architecture &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define end-to-end architectures (data, ML/LLM, APIs, security), make build/buy decisions, and drive projects from PoC to production with reliability, observability, and cost in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Lead complex PoCs &amp;amp; pilots:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, prototype, and validate AI/ML use cases (incl. LLMs/GenAI, RAG, fine-tuning, evaluation) and convert successful pilots into scalable products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;
