&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Engagement Manager in our Zurich or Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers, and you will be accountable for whether the design survives contact with production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Run engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feasibility &amp;amp; Economics:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the answer to &quot;will this work, and what will it cost&quot;. The evaluation approach, the unit economics per query or per case, and the point at which the business case stops closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead mixed teams of consultants, data scientists and engineers. You are the person who can tell whether the technical plan is realistic, and the person the client believes when you say that it is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich and Lausanne offices by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time, and lead a team through both. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field. A strong technical foundation counts for more with us than where you studied.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Five to eight years across consulting and technology delivery, including at least one dedicated AI or data project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong dual affinity for business and technology. You have a deep working understanding of modern data and AI concepts — generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud architectures — and of their practical business applications. You are capable of scoping AI use cases and of discussing technical constraints and opportunities confidently with C-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have owned the technical shape of AI work, not only its business case. You think in terms of enterprise architecture — how a solution fits the existing landscape, what it needs from data and governance, and how it scales from pilot to full rollout — and can defend those choices to technical and commercial stakeholders alike. You will not be writing production code, but you should have been close enough to it to be credible with the engineers with which you will collaborate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You can take a technical trade-off to a non-technical sponsor without flattening it, and be challenged by an engineer without retreating into abstraction. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Robotics &amp;amp; Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (m/f/d) Industrial Robot Control&lt;/strong&gt;, who will develop C++ control software for the robot arm, from single-motor to multi-body control.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control Software:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and develop C++ software for the robot&#39;s control stack, covering kinematics, trajectory generation, and compliance control from single-motor to multi-body coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Tuning:&lt;/strong&gt; Support parameter identification and controller-gain tuning against physical hardware, working alongside more senior engineers to close the gap between simulation and real behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-Time Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Profile control software and help keep it within the timing margins the arm&#39;s safety and stability depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Write automated software tests, define hardware testing procedures, and work hands-on with the robot to confirm control software behaves correctly outside simulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Take part in code reviews with the wider team, both giving and receiving feedback that keeps the control codebase maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Evaluation:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate and evaluate emerging robotic control methods and algorithms relevant to the team&#39;s work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in computer science, control engineering, mechatronics, or a related engineering field, with one to three years of professional experience in C++ development, or an equivalent record of relevant academic or project work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kinematics &amp;amp; Dynamics:&lt;/strong&gt; Working understanding of robot kinematics and dynamics, sufficient to reason about forward and inverse mappings and trajectory generation for a multi-body arm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Control Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in control engineering, with some exposure to parameter identification and controller tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern C++:&lt;/strong&gt; Working proficiency in modern C++, including thread-safe and exception-safe code, and comfort working across the standard build, test, and debugging toolchain on Linux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic ability and willingness to troubleshoot and debug directly on physical robotic hardware, not only software running in isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python:&lt;/strong&gt; Working programming skills in Python or a similar scripting language, used alongside C++ for tooling and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience maintaining or extending CI/CD pipelines for a C++ codebase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Robotics &amp;amp; Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Mechatronics and Hardware Test Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, who will design and build the test setups and fixtures used to qualify robot prototypes for development. You will help close the loop between test results and design fixes, working with the engineering and production teams that build the robot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Fixtures:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build the mechatronic test setups and fixtures used to validate robot prototypes and subassemblies through development, certification, and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Run tests, evaluate and analyze the results, and share findings with the wider engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and maintain documentation for test procedures and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and implement improvements to existing test procedures to increase efficiency and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Root Cause Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate product-related quality issues to determine their root cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the production team in troubleshooting and resolving test-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in mechanical engineering or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mechatronic Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Industry experience testing, verifying, and analyzing mechatronic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in mechanical design, including test benches and fixtures, using tools such as SolidWorks, 3DEXPERIENCE, or PDM software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lab Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on mechanical lab experience, such as drilling and assembly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sensor Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with sensor applications such as force and torque sensors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience automating test benches and robotic systems, for example using Python or PLC programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Interfaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with embedded and industrial communication interfaces such as CAN, SPI, OPC UA, or EtherCAT, and the Linux/Unix environments (e.g., Bash) used to work with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with requirements management and quality management tools such as Jama or SAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German Language:&lt;/strong&gt; German language proficiency for collaborating with site-based teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving License:&lt;/strong&gt; Valid driving license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless, a Mollie company, is a global leader in bank payments. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&amp;nbsp; For more information, please visit&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gocardless.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; www.gocardless.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; ----- is the leading payments and financial services partner for business, rooted in Europe, with global reach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data sits at the core of our mission. We leverage bank account data to deliver high-value, intelligent payment solutions for our customers, from enhancing payment success rates to driving payer fraud prevention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Scientist within our Payment Intelligence team, you’ll partner with Software Engineers, Product Managers, and Designers to turn big ideas into reality. You’ll own the full lifecycle of our algorithms, shaping everything from the initial concept to production-ready code that powers our global payment network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GoCardless, our stack is centered around Google Cloud Platform and Vertex AI, providing a high-performance environment for innovation. Our Data Scientists operate at the intersection of Python, SQL, and BigQuery to build and deploy high-performance models at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end delivery of models at scale, from initial discovery and feature engineering to production, A/B testing and continuous monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and engineering peers to turn complex data into real-time, mission-critical fraud prevention solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the team’s collective bar through hands-on technical leadership and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively research and integrate latest developments in ML and payer fraud prevention to drive innovation at GoCardless.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a self-starter who thrives on taking a vague business problem and owning the journey from the first prototype to a live, measurable solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to introduce and scale advanced architectures to solve high-stakes fraud and payment challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Moving beyond execution to help define the technical roadmap for Payer Fraud Prevention, ensuring we leverage the best tools for the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building production-grade ML models on a streamlined GCP and Vertex AI stack to drive fintech innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a degree (or PhD) in a STEM discipline or an equivalent commercial experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring hands-on experience with sophisticated architectures, such as deep learning, graph-based, or sequence-based models (experience in Fintech, Fraud Prevention, or Payments is a big plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate complex ML concepts into practical product solutions and communicate these ideas clearly to non-technical peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable owning the full lifecycle, from deep-dive analysis and feature engineering to prototyping, validation, and live A/B testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead by example, writing clean, high-quality code and raising the team’s technical bar through knowledge sharing and code best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary range:&lt;/strong&gt; £99,200 - £148,800&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges are based on role, job level, location, and market data.&amp;nbsp; Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, our approach is to pay between the &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;minimum and the mid-point&lt;/span&gt; of the pay range until performance can be assessed in role. Offers will take into account level of experience, interview assessment, budgets and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 90 days in any 12 month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance, + 3 annual volunteer days, + 4 annual business-wide wellness days (‘GC Fridays’)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;em&gt;start with why &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;, always. We &lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;whilst we do it. Working this way creates the GC magic- the reason we all love showing up to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As of April 2025, we had 806 employees (GeeCees) globally, with 524 based in the UK, 163 based in Latvia and 119 across our other offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;To ensure that we&#39;re representative of the world around us - and to be able to review relevant benchmarks - we ask GeeCees to voluntarily disclose diversity data. This year, the proportion of GeeCees providing data increased to 88% (up from 79% in 2024). With regards to diversity within GoCardless, we can see GeeCees identifying as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Asian, Black, Mixed or Other — &lt;strong&gt;25%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Neurodiverse — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;LGBTQIA+ — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Disabled — &lt;strong&gt;1%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Average age — &lt;strong&gt;33&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Female — &lt;strong&gt;45%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Male —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; 55%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rooting for you during your application and GoCardless aims to provide reasonable adjustments to make our recruitment process as remarkable and accessible as we can. Please speak to your Talent Partner if you need extra support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more, you can read about our Employee Resource Groups and objectives &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/about/careers/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1DeqgyeRfEwEzecwn4oq3j&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re committed to reducing our impact on the environment, leaving a more sustainable world for future generations. Check out our sustainability &lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/sustainability&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;action plan&lt;/u&gt; &lt;/a&gt;here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Analyst Backend E-commerce (f/m/d)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre &lt;strong&gt;équipe Backend E-commerce&lt;/strong&gt; recherche un·e &lt;strong&gt;Data Analyst (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;basé·e à &lt;strong&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRÉSENTATION DE L&#39;ÉQUIPE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rejoins une équipe dynamique de 15 passionné·es (développeur·euses, product owners, data engineers) au cœur de la stratégie digitale de Decathlon. Notre objectif : garantir la robustesse et l&#39;efficacité des flux de données qui propulsent notre plateforme e-commerce mondiale. Ton impact sera direct sur l&#39;expérience de millions de sportifs et sportives, avec pour défi d&#39;allier performance technique et innovation responsable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Senior Data Analyst, tu seras le pont entre les données brutes backend et les décisions stratégiques. Tes missions s&#39;articuleront autour de 4 piliers :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyse et Interprétation des Données&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et mettre en œuvre des analyses pour extraire des informations utiles (ventes, tendances, comportements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utiliser des méthodes statistiques (analyse descriptive, ACP, classifications) pour résoudre des problématiques business complexes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traduire les besoins des équipes métier (Business, Marketing, Produit) en problèmes analytiques concrets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être capable de remettre en question les demandes métier non pertinentes, de prioriser.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider au développement d&#39;outils de segmentation clients et de modèles de scoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Préparation et Modélisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer au nettoyage, à l&#39;exploration et à la préparation des jeux de données et à leur mise en qualité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer et assurer la maintenance des pipelines de traitement de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer au développement, aux tests et à l&#39;évaluation de modèles d&#39;IA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visualisation et Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Présenter les résultats de manière claire et percutante aux différentes parties prenantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choisir le bon niveau de rendu pour répondre à une question avec le support approprié.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Créer des tableaux de bord (Dashboards) et des agents IA pour le suivi des indicateurs clés (KPIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatiser l&#39;envoi d&#39;analyses et permettre l&#39;accès à la donnée en self-service à travers notre semantic layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration et Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Évoluer dans un environnement Agile avec des outils modernes (Git).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partager au sein de l&#39;équipe les bonnes pratiques techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer une veille technologique sur les nouvelles tendances en data analyse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimiser la dette technique en anticipant les besoins à venir.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garder une documentation claire de son travail pour faciliter sa transmission à un pair.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Analytiques :&lt;/strong&gt; Une maîtrise des fondamentaux statistiques et une capacité à transformer la donnée en action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset :&lt;/strong&gt; Une forte appétence pour le business, la connaissance client et la création de valeur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture :&lt;/strong&gt; Un esprit d&#39;équipe prononcé, le goût du partage et un intérêt pour l&#39;impact du sport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement :&lt;/strong&gt; L&#39;envie de rejoindre une entreprise Tech4Good et de contribuer à une innovation responsable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks (SQL / Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DBT / Airflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tableau for data visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POURQUOI NOUS REJOINDRE ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous mettons un point d’honneur à offrir un cadre de travail épanouissant et motivant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Un environnement de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; : entreprise certifiée &lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Happy Trainees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Des avantages attractifs&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(après 3 mois d’ancienneté)&lt;/em&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primes mensuelles, intéressement, actionnariat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avantages CSE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25% de réduction&lt;/strong&gt; sur nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prise en charge de ta CVEC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remboursement de 50%&lt;/strong&gt; du titre de transport &amp;amp; aide à la mobilité urbaine&lt;br&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Un accompagnement sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt; : coaching, formations internes et externes, partage de connaissances.&lt;br&gt;⚡ &lt;strong&gt;Une culture du sport et du test produit&lt;/strong&gt; : deviens ambassadeur.trice de nos innovations et rejoins nos équipes sportives internes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Engineering Manager to lead a team building core internal infrastructure and developer-facing systems.&amp;nbsp;This role sits at the intersection of project management, engineering leadership, and platform development. The team (Evaluation Engines / Data processing engines) owns foundational components which are embedded into higher level workflow engines and tools. Examples are formula evaluation, data transformation according to predefined mapping, decision models, etc. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The team is technically strong and highly autonomous. We are looking for an Engineering Manager who can operate effectively in this environment: someone with a strong engineering background who understands complex systems, but does not need to be the deepest technical expert in every area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role will be to help experienced engineers work effectively together, create clarity across interconnected initiatives, and improve how the team plans, collaborates, and delivers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead a strong engineering team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage and develop experienced engineers with significant ownership of their technical domains. The team is mostly Rust engineers, however they also build libraries for several other programming languages: Go, Ruby, Java, Python, and WASM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for regular 1:1s, feedback, performance management, career development, hiring, onboarding, and team health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect you to create an environment where engineers can remain highly autonomous while having clear priorities, ownership, and accountability. You will be responsible for team capacity planning and hiring when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working closely with Product Managers and department VP to define how the products look, what to build and in which order, what new exciting features we can bring to our customers. As this area is highly technical and speaks Computer Science terms at times, Product Managers will greatly rely on your and your team expertise to make decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for working with Quality Engineering and Product Security teams to deliver high-quality products. At the same time in this AI era we expect you to embrace new tools to shift quality and security scans left.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive planning and execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team owns several interconnected technical areas, often developed across separate repositories and involving dependencies between engineers and projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own planning and operational execution across multiple engineering workstreams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create visibility into priorities, dependencies, timelines, and resource allocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help the team turn broad technical direction into an executable roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and remove blockers before they significantly impact delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Balance new development, customer commitments, operational work, and technical debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define meaningful engineering metrics and use them to identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep stakeholders informed about progress, risks, and trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan release and update cycles of the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain the product, be responsible for defects triaging and mitigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is strictly not a purely people-management role. Technical background and experience is a must.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t expect you to be a fluent Rust developer, we in fact are not expecting you to know Rust at all. But you should be comfortable participating in technical discussions, reviewing designs and architecture proposals, understanding engineering trade-offs, and challenging assumptions when needed. You should have a wide industry knowledge, and understand the pros and cons of different programming languages and platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your background and interests, you may also review code, contribute to tooling or prototypes, participate in incident investigation, or use automation and AI-assisted development to improve engineering workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the same time, we do not expect the Engineering Manager to make every technical decision. Senior engineers (your team will contain a mix of engineers up to Staff and Architect levels) own significant parts of the technical direction, and a key part of the role is enabling them to do that effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant software engineering experience before or alongside engineering management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing senior, autonomous engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong background in platform engineering, developer infrastructure, developer productivity, backend infrastructure, or distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with CI/CD, release engineering, developer tooling, or internal engineering platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience owning roadmaps and delivering multi-quarter engineering initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of software development lifecycle and engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing technical debt alongside product and business priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to understand complex technical discussions without needing to personally own every implementation decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience hiring, coaching, and developing engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic approach to engineering processes: enough structure to make teams effective, without unnecessary bureaucracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Someone Successful in This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable joining a team where engineers may understand individual systems more deeply than you do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instead of trying to become the technical owner of every component, you ask the right questions, understand trade-offs, create clarity, and help engineers make good decisions together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy finding problems in the engineering system itself: unclear ownership, slow reviews, hidden dependencies, fragmented tooling, competing priorities, or processes that depend too heavily on individuals pushing things forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can move between a conversation about architecture or CI pipelines, a 1:1 with an engineer, roadmap prioritization with Product, and a discussion about why delivery is taking longer than expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable aligning your team roadmap with requirements from Product Managers, and from Engineering leadership, which may be different, and working with different stakeholders in general.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you combine technical credibility with strong people and execution leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with some of the following would be particularly relevant:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Golang or Rust; understanding of WASM platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Basic understanding of formal grammar, AST, compiler frontends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Observability and operational tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open-source development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted software development and automated code review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PostgreSQL or database infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multi-repository development environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developer-facing APIs, SDKs, libraries, or integrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
